  "details": "If you're looking in a mirror, and turn your head just right, you can see the shadows of certain objects disappear. This can be fairly subtle for small objects, but if a room is lit through a window, where the rest of the window's wall normally darkens the room, the mirror will just suddenly become bright as the wall's shadow completely vanishes when your head is in certain positions.\nI could make a map that clearly demonstrates this problem if necessary, but I thought I'd check first whether it's a known issue already.",
